<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Outfits for the liquefied creature types. dressInNamedOutfit is the only
  dressing path that reliably sticks on a zombie, and an outfit also travels in
  the engine's own zombie sync, so clients can tell a creature's type from its
  outfit name without any network code of ours.

  PLACEHOLDER LOOK: a random top and trousers, so they still read as human, plus
  one hard hat whose colour marks the type:
    Conjoined = yellow, Caller = white, Grasper = red, Mass = blue.
  Each outfit is defined for both sexes; an outfit missing from one list makes
  the engine silently dress that sex in nothing.
-->
